{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108700","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1510870001:1":{"text":"そんな！ロンゴス……兵士たちが……なぜ、こんなことに！？","source_cn":"不！隆尔……士兵们……怎么会这样？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ADC5842534DA6D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510870002:0":{"text":"狩猟神は最初から、あなたを騙していたのです。","source_cn":"狩猎神没有遵守诺言。从一开始，她就是在骗你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10FDE14856BC11EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510870003:0":{"text":"戻って、隊を指揮してください。あなたがいれば、兵士たちにはまだ生き残れる希望があります。","source_cn":"你必须回去指挥战局。有你在，呼临士兵才有存活的希望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F5EAC5572808400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510870004:0":{"text":"い、今のが……魔法で作り出した幻覚でないと証明できるか？","source_cn":"你……怎么证明刚才的一切不是用魔法构建的幻术？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F86952682B20B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510870005:0":{"text":"その必要はありません。信じられないのなら、自分で風沼の戦場へ行って確かめればいいのです。","source_cn":"我不必证明。如果你不愿意相信我的魔法，更应该去风沼战场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D8A1314483D4E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu